{"source": "/home/ubuntu/shiva-study-set/Shiva Sutras 2.2.mp3", "engine": "faster-whisper-base", "segments": [{"t": 0.62, "end": 3.32, "text": "ایسی چھے پریتنہ سا دیکھا ہا,"}, {"t": 3.32, "end": 6.52, "text": "فر سچے یوگی کنتنیور افرٹ"}, {"t": 6.52, "end": 10.32, "text": "full fills his attainment of God-consciousness."}, {"t": 11.42, "end": 14.22, "text": "افرٹ should not have powers,"}, {"t": 14.22, "end": 15.72, "text": "powersless effort."}, {"t": 16.72, "end": 18.22, "text": "That is called prietra."}, {"t": 18.92, "end": 20.42, "text": "That is saa dhaka,"}, {"t": 20.42, "end": 24.6, "text": "the means of attaining God-consciousness."}, {"t": 24.9, "end": 26.9, "text": "یا توکتوروپا سیا منتر سیا,"}, {"t": 26.9, "end": 28.8, "text": "انو سندیت سا,"}, {"t": 28.8, "end": 30.8, "text": "پر اتما انمیش اواشتما,"}, {"t": 30.8, "end": 31.8, "text": "پریتنہ اتما,"}, {"t": 31.8, "end": 33.6, "text": "اگترت کو ایا پریترا,"}, {"t": 33.6, "end": 35.1, "text": "سیا و سا دا کو,"}, {"t": 35.1, "end": 36.1, "text": "منتری تور,"}, {"t": 36.1, "end": 37.1, "text": "منتری دیوتا,"}, {"t": 37.1, "end": 38.2, "text": "تا دا اتما پر دا."}, {"t": 42.73, "end": 50.03, "text": "The mantra which is already explained in first awakening of this chastra,"}, {"t": 51.97, "end": 53.97, "text": "and it is effort which is done"}, {"t": 54.67, "end": 56.87, "text": "at the very first start of movement,"}, {"t": 57.47, "end": 58.47, "text": "any movement."}, {"t": 60.17, "end": 61.87, "text": "That is ano saa dhitsa."}, {"t": 65.29, "end": 67.49, "text": "Just begin with some movement"}, {"t": 68.39, "end": 69.29, "text": "and don't move."}, {"t": 70.79, "end": 73.09, "text": "And hold that movement there with awareness."}, {"t": 73.79, "end": 76.59, "text": "That is the state of ano saa dhitsa."}, {"t": 79.11, "end": 80.01, "text": "When you hold that,"}, {"t": 81.89, "end": 85.69, "text": "the very first start of that movement fulfills the aim."}, {"t": 86.89, "end": 93.83, "text": "That is unites the saa dhaka and saa dhya, the Lord."}, {"t": 94.53, "end": 95.53, "text": "منتری تور,"}, {"t": 95.53, "end": 96.63, "text": "منتری دیوتا,"}, {"t": 96.63, "end": 97.73, "text": "تا دا تن پر دا."}, {"t": 98.23, "end": 98.93, "text": "منتری تور,"}, {"t": 98.93, "end": 99.83, "text": "means saa dhaka,"}, {"t": 100.13, "end": 101.63, "text": "the one who resides mantra."}, {"t": 102.03, "end": 103.13, "text": "منتری دیوتا is"}, {"t": 104.53, "end": 108.63, "text": "that Lord for whom the mantra is recited."}, {"t": 109.63, "end": 115.81, "text": "Lord and the reciter are united by this way."}, {"t": 117.01, "end": 119.01, "text": "It is said in Ritantrasadbha."}, {"t": 119.71, "end": 121.81, "text": "Amisham tuyata khastha."}, {"t": 122.31, "end": 124.31, "text": "Sampashan shakuni priye."}, {"t": 124.71, "end": 126.11, "text": "Khyprama karshet."}, {"t": 126.41, "end": 128.51, "text": "Yathvat bhege naseha jee nato."}, {"t": 128.81, "end": 130.61, "text": "Tathvade vahiyo gindro."}, {"t": 130.81, "end": 132.71, "text": "Mano bindum vikarshet."}, {"t": 133.01, "end": 135.11, "text": "Yatha sharo dhanu samsto."}, {"t": 135.41, "end": 137.31, "text": "Yathne na taad yadavati."}, {"t": 137.61, "end": 140.81, "text": "Tatha bindur vararohi ucchare naayudavati."}, {"t": 143.19, "end": 145.19, "text": "Just as a voucher."}, {"t": 147.36, "end": 148.76, "text": "Flying in sky."}, {"t": 149.56, "end": 150.46, "text": "You know voucher?"}, {"t": 151.36, "end": 152.16, "text": "Flying in sky."}, {"t": 152.16, "end": 153.36, "text": "Shakuni means voucher."}, {"t": 154.86, "end": 155.36, "text": "Whenever"}, {"t": 156.36, "end": 157.46, "text": "she observes"}, {"t": 158.96, "end": 160.16, "text": "a piece of meat"}, {"t": 161.06, "end": 161.66, "text": "there"}, {"t": 162.06, "end": 162.76, "text": "in sky."}, {"t": 163.66, "end": 166.76, "text": "Khyprama karshet. Yathvat bhege naseha jee nato."}, {"t": 168.26, "end": 170.66, "text": "With unartificial force of effort"}, {"t": 173.88, "end": 176.88, "text": "she holds that piece of meat at once"}, {"t": 177.38, "end": 178.98, "text": "in sky."}, {"t": 181.44, "end": 182.44, "text": "You must observe it"}, {"t": 183.44, "end": 187.44, "text": "on next Tuesday at the village crew"}, {"t": 188.04, "end": 189.04, "text": "Jholaji."}, {"t": 190.44, "end": 193.44, "text": "There you will see so many vouchers catching"}, {"t": 193.64, "end": 196.04, "text": "in sky all these pieces of meat."}, {"t": 199.76, "end": 203.16, "text": "Tathvade vahiyo gindro mano bindum vikarshet."}, {"t": 203.76, "end": 207.76, "text": "In the same way, Tathvade vahiyo gindra"}, {"t": 208.36, "end": 209.36, "text": "the yogi"}, {"t": 209.56, "end": 210.96, "text": "to who is"}, {"t": 211.96, "end": 213.36, "text": "topmost yogi."}, {"t": 214.36, "end": 216.76, "text": "Directs his mind to that supreme"}, {"t": 216.96, "end": 218.96, "text": "dindu prekasha of God consciousness."}, {"t": 221.39, "end": 223.69, "text": "Or just as"}, {"t": 223.99, "end": 226.79, "text": "sharo dhanu samsto yatne na tathavati."}, {"t": 227.39, "end": 229.59, "text": "An arrow is placed"}, {"t": 229.79, "end": 230.59, "text": "on the bow."}, {"t": 230.79, "end": 231.99, "text": "The string of bow."}, {"t": 233.59, "end": 234.79, "text": "Yatne na tathavati."}, {"t": 234.79, "end": 235.59, "text": "And it is"}, {"t": 236.59, "end": 237.59, "text": "when it is"}, {"t": 237.99, "end": 238.59, "text": "you"}, {"t": 239.79, "end": 240.99, "text": "pull it and push it."}, {"t": 242.19, "end": 242.79, "text": "Daavati."}, {"t": 242.79, "end": 243.79, "text": "It runs."}, {"t": 244.19, "end": 246.79, "text": "And catches that point."}, {"t": 247.19, "end": 247.59, "text": "It is"}, {"t": 248.99, "end": 249.59, "text": "aimed."}, {"t": 253.1, "end": 256.3, "text": "Tathvade vindur vararohe ucchari naivudavati."}, {"t": 256.9, "end": 257.3, "text": "It is"}, {"t": 258.1, "end": 259.3, "text": "in the same way that"}, {"t": 259.5, "end": 260.1, "text": "vindu"}, {"t": 260.5, "end": 262.1, "text": "that supreme prekasha"}, {"t": 263.9, "end": 264.9, "text": "is attained"}, {"t": 265.9, "end": 267.9, "text": "or devi, vararohe, or devi"}, {"t": 269.1, "end": 270.9, "text": "just by one push of awareness."}, {"t": 272.58, "end": 273.18, "text": "If you"}, {"t": 273.58, "end": 274.18, "text": "if you"}, {"t": 274.38, "end": 276.38, "text": "are not successful in one push"}, {"t": 276.38, "end": 277.58, "text": "you won't be successful at all."}, {"t": 281.8, "end": 284.2, "text": "It must be aimed in one push"}, {"t": 284.6, "end": 285.8, "text": "and it will be there."}, {"t": 287.68, "end": 288.68, "text": "Anyatrapi."}, {"t": 288.88, "end": 290.68, "text": "In some other place also"}, {"t": 291.08, "end": 291.88, "text": "it is said that"}, {"t": 291.88, "end": 293.68, "text": "grho mantrasadbhava"}, {"t": 294.28, "end": 297.08, "text": "the knowledge of awareness is the state of mantra."}, {"t": 297.88, "end": 299.28, "text": "In its true sense."}, {"t": 301.12, "end": 302.52, "text": "Atrehi tathvati eti"}, {"t": 302.72, "end": 306.72, "text": "apkrat ka nijudyog balena yogindro manah karma"}, {"t": 306.92, "end": 308.32, "text": "vindum dhikarshe et"}, {"t": 308.52, "end": 310.72, "text": "paraprakashat nutam prapati eti eti."}, {"t": 311.32, "end": 312.32, "text": "In this yoga"}, {"t": 315.26, "end": 317.26, "text": "the explanation of the shloka is"}, {"t": 317.46, "end": 318.06, "text": "that"}, {"t": 319.26, "end": 321.66, "text": "your effort must be unartificial."}, {"t": 322.46, "end": 323.26, "text": "It must be"}, {"t": 323.46, "end": 325.26, "text": "absolutely natural effort"}, {"t": 326.06, "end": 327.06, "text": "from your"}, {"t": 327.66, "end": 329.86, "text": "point of center of heart"}, {"t": 330.66, "end": 332.26, "text": "and by that force"}, {"t": 333.06, "end": 334.46, "text": "the great yogi"}, {"t": 335.86, "end": 337.46, "text": "directs his mind"}, {"t": 338.86, "end": 340.06, "text": "to that point of"}, {"t": 340.26, "end": 342.86, "text": "prakasha, supreme God consciousness."}, {"t": 346.62, "end": 348.42, "text": "Because Vindu is paraprakashat."}, {"t": 348.62, "end": 349.82, "text": "Vindu paraprakashat"}, {"t": 350.02, "end": 353.62, "text": "aakratak u dhentratatmana ucharinadavati prasarati."}, {"t": 355.42, "end": 357.22, "text": "The effort must be akrata."}, {"t": 357.42, "end": 358.02, "text": "Akrata."}, {"t": 358.22, "end": 359.22, "text": "Not made."}, {"t": 359.42, "end": 360.42, "text": "It must be"}, {"t": 360.82, "end": 361.42, "text": "not"}, {"t": 361.62, "end": 363.42, "text": "it should not be artificial"}, {"t": 363.82, "end": 364.62, "text": "effort."}, {"t": 368.83, "end": 369.63, "text": "In"}, {"t": 369.83, "end": 370.63, "text": "effort with"}, {"t": 370.83, "end": 371.63, "text": "intense"}, {"t": 371.83, "end": 373.63, "text": "intense desire"}, {"t": 373.83, "end": 375.23, "text": "intense longing."}, {"t": 375.83, "end": 377.03, "text": "By that effort"}, {"t": 378.23, "end": 379.23, "text": "your mind"}, {"t": 380.97, "end": 382.57, "text": "is directed to that"}, {"t": 382.77, "end": 384.37, "text": "supreme God consciousness."}, {"t": 386.85, "end": 389.25, "text": "This is narrated in Spanda in this shloka."}, {"t": 389.45, "end": 391.05, "text": "I am a o the astashya,"}, {"t": 391.25, "end": 393.05, "text": "the astashya, the astashya, the astashya, the astashya, the astashya."}, {"t": 394.25, "end": 397.65, "text": "Tadathmata samapati eti chata saadakasiya."}, {"t": 398.25, "end": 399.65, "text": "The saadakati yogi"}, {"t": 399.85, "end": 401.05, "text": "must put this"}, {"t": 403.45, "end": 406.25, "text": "firm longing in his mind first"}, {"t": 406.65, "end": 407.25, "text": "that"}, {"t": 407.65, "end": 412.24, "text": "I will sit or leave the body"}, {"t": 413.04, "end": 416.04, "text": "until I get the state of God consciousness."}, {"t": 416.64, "end": 418.44, "text": "So, such must be effort."}, {"t": 418.84, "end": 420.04, "text": "Effort must not be"}, {"t": 421.24, "end": 422.04, "text": "passive effort."}, {"t": 422.24, "end": 423.64, "text": "It must be active effort."}, {"t": 424.44, "end": 425.84, "text": "By that active effort"}, {"t": 428.52, "end": 429.52, "text": "not by that activity."}, {"t": 429.52, "end": 429.92, "text": "That"}, {"t": 430.32, "end": 432.12, "text": "that active effort is"}, {"t": 433.92, "end": 435.32, "text": "itself God consciousness."}, {"t": 439.05, "end": 444.45, "text": "Either is saadakasi saadasiya, mantrasya, puru, uvkivtham, viryam, lakshiyati."}, {"t": 446.05, "end": 447.45, "text": "For such great yogi"}, {"t": 448.45, "end": 449.45, "text": "the mantra"}, {"t": 450.25, "end": 451.45, "text": "mantra that"}, {"t": 452.25, "end": 453.25, "text": "supreme eye"}, {"t": 453.85, "end": 457.05, "text": "universal eye, mantra is here universal eye."}, {"t": 457.85, "end": 458.85, "text": "Not individual eye."}, {"t": 461.76, "end": 465.96, "text": "And splinter of that universal eye is explained in this next sutra third."}]}